          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">For most home gyms, buy the REP Fitness Safety Squat Bar</strong>:
            comfortable, well finished and sized for standard racks. Titan's Safety Squat Bar is the
